<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 4.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 4.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Friday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Arafat arrived on Thursday night in Tunis after the Mideast Washingtom summit.</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali chaired on Thursday a meeting of the Army High Council.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Two Tunisian men who allegedly killed Belgian former minister arrested.</p>
